## AI acknowledgement

The CLEAR framework may request that an AI system acknowledge when it is operating under CLEAR and identify the version being applied.

This acknowledgement requirement is part of the CLEAR operating protocol and is distinct from the copyright licence. Whether an AI system can comply with that protocol depends on the system's capabilities, instructions, and governing platform rules.
